put.description:
The hours this account likes to post, by weekday, in its own zone
(2026-10-22, docs/tasks/task-calendar.md). Nothing is sent by them;
the calendar and the drawer read them.

get.description:
What an attached reference can be FOR (src/ref_roles.py): the menu
the composer draws on each reference. A projection of the one table;
`look_only` marks the roles that never anchor a keyframe or a clip.

The project's chat history, newest `limit` turns oldest-first;
`?before=<message id>` pages back. Written by the Guide turn itself
(`remember=1` on /creative-guide inside a project).

post.description:
Polled every `interval` seconds by the panel holding the secret.
200 once a person approved it; 400 `authorization_pending` until then;
400 `expired_token` after ten minutes (start again).
